Ghost Tree was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with a cost of 4G. '''Beta 31.0''', which also changed many other Deltarune cards, reduced that to 3G. '''Beta 31.2''' made it count as a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Plant Plant].
[[File:Ghost Tree (Beta 31.2).png|thumb|294x294px|Beta 31.2]]
'''Beta 39.0''' changed it quite a bit. It gained +2/-2, going from 1/4 to 3/2. However, its effect will no longer give +1 ATK when you summon a Plant, only +1 HP. '''Beta 42.1''' gave it Transparency.
